    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frak is a fast-paced, movement-shooter, rogue-like that aims to immerse audiences with a simple gameplay loop. <br><br>You play as an escaped employee trapped beneath the mines of a foreign planet attempting to escape against overwhelming odds the infected former coworkers of your facility. Will you survive, or you will you be trapped in the loop destined to cycle forever against unwavering forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a former worker, you will have access to maneuverability tech for traversing the mines. You will be able to wallrun and use your thrusters to dash through the air or boost around on the ground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mines sought after a powerful material that gave those that wield it unique abilities. You can find these in each room designated by the doorways leading to different refinery sections. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the ancient material, grow stronger, and find a way to escape! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frak is a fast-paced, movement-shooter, rogue-like that aims to immerse audiences with a simple gameplay loop. <br><br>You play as an escaped employee trapped beneath the mines of a foreign planet attempting to escape against overwhelming odds the infected former coworkers of your facility. Will you survive, or you will you be trapped in the loop destined to cycle forever against unwavering forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a former worker, you will have access to maneuverability tech for traversing the mines. You will be able to wallrun and use your thrusters to dash through the air or boost around on the ground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mines sought after a powerful material that gave those that wield it unique abilities. You can find these in each room designated by the doorways leading to different refinery sections. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the ancient material, grow stronger, and find a way to escape! </p>",
